3. DB 테이블 설계 (MVP)
A) Admin
admin_users

id BIGINT PK

username VARCHAR UNIQUE

password_hash VARCHAR

name VARCHAR

is_active BOOLEAN

created_at, updated_at TIMESTAMP

admin_roles

id BIGINT PK

role_name VARCHAR UNIQUE

admin_user_roles

admin_user_id FK

admin_role_id FK

PK(admin_user_id, admin_role_id)

B) 채팅 로그(조회/상세)
conversations

id BIGINT PK

user_email VARCHAR (또는 user_id FK)

